sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User/Mic
  participant FE as Next.js
  participant WS as WS Gateway
  participant ASR as ASR Adapter
  participant MT as MT Adapter
  participant V as Verifier
  participant TTS as TTS Adapter
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>FE: Microphone permission & push-to-talk
  FE->>WS: Authenticated short-lived WS ticket
  WS-->>FE: capabilities + negotiated audio format
  loop each sequenced audio frame
    FE->>WS: PCM frame (seq, ts, 16kHz)
    WS->>ASR: VAD + buffered stable chunk
    ASR-->>WS: partial/stable ASR
    WS-->>FE: original text partial
    WS->>MT: translate stable prefix, direction EN/VI
    MT-->>WS: provisional target
    WS->>V: check numbers, negation, units, entities
    alt verification passed and stable
      V-->>WS: confirmed segment
      WS-->>FE: confirmed subtitle revision
      WS->>TTS: only verified confirmed text
      TTS-->>FE: playable audio chunk
    else uncertain or failed
      V-->>WS: warning + hold
      WS-->>FE: provisional/warning; await context
    end
  end
  WS->>DB: Persist consented session + segments
  WS-->>FE: metrics snapshot and final status
